35,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen. But the fuel receipts show a lopsided story: two of us bought over half the litres, and one barely shows up.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,I found that other groups soured because they had to ask for favours constantly. We must avoid that dynamic.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The data confirms my suspicion. The car is handed over with the fuel light on and rubbish inside. My weekly trips keep collapsing because of this neglect.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The receipts confirm the imbalance. Two of us bought over half the fuel, while one barely shows up. We need to address this disparity before deciding on a payment structure.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found the diary shows Saturdays are used three times more than Tuesdays. And the mechanic said short, cold runs damage the car faster.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"So an even split ignores that two of us drive far more. We need a system that accounts for actual usage, not just equal shares.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Minako"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Minako: So an even split ignores that two of us drive far more. We need a system that accounts for actual usage, not just equal shares.""}]}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,The other households failed because asking for favours became the norm. We need a system that removes that constant negotiation.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Benjamin"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Benjamin: The other households failed because asking for favours became the norm. We need a system that removes that constant negotiation.""}]}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, a system that ignores the car’s physical state is useless. If it’s handed over with the fuel light on, no payment structure fixes my morning.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, you’re right. Equal shares are a fiction. The data proves usage is wildly uneven. We need a system that reflects actual distance, not just headcount.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I’m sorry. I just wanted to understand the time cost. The diary shows the unevenness, but I don’t know how to fix it.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, the physical state is a separate issue from the financial split. We need to solve the money first, then the maintenance.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, the state is a symptom of the friction. If we remove the favour-asking, the neglect might stop.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, removing friction won’t magically clean the car. I need a system that guarantees the vehicle is ready before I even start the engine.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, the state is a symptom of the lack of accountability. If we track every run, the neglect becomes visible and harder to ignore.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with Shion. If we track the runs, the neglect becomes visible. It might help us understand the time cost better.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,"We have the facts. The 280,000 yen baseline is fixed, but fuel is uneven. We need a system that balances both.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Minako"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Minako: We have the facts. The 280,000 yen baseline is fixed, but fuel is uneven. We need a system that balances both.""}]}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,The other households failed because asking for favours became the norm. We need a system that removes that constant negotiation.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, I reject that separation. A car that isn’t ready is a car I can’t use. The state is the primary failure, not the money.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, accountability is the only fix. If we don’t track the runs, we’re just guessing again. I refuse to pay for your neglect.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Shion. Tracking the runs makes the neglect visible. It might help us understand the time cost better.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
